---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="0xCCCFFF · Controlled Chaos Club · Stavros Kousidis"
  description="Controlled Chaos Club: optional live systems experiments, troubleshooting, and other practical computer nonsense."
>
  <section class="page-intro">
    <div class="cccfff-mark" title="0xCCCFFF = 13422591">0xCCCFFF</div>
    <h1>Controlled Chaos Club</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Optional live systems experiments, troubleshooting, and other practical computer nonsense
      during selected Open Lab sessions. Student suggestions welcome.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="three-fs-title">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="kicker">Failure · Flipping out · Freedom</p>
        <h2 id="three-fs-title">Three Fs for controlled chaos</h2>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="signal-grid">
      <div>
        <span>01 · Failure</span>
        <strong>Failure</strong>
        <p>Fail, understand why, and learn something real.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span>02 · Flipping out</span>
        <strong>Flipping out</strong>
        <p>Break things, lose the plot for a moment, and find your way back on track.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span>03 · Freedom</span>
        <strong>Freedom</strong>
        <p>The freedom to explore, experiment, and build technological sovereignty.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="note">
    <div>
      <p class="kicker">Working principle</p>
      <h2>Getting back on track is part of the experiment.</h2>
    </div>
    <p>
      The goal is not to avoid chaos — it is to learn how to handle it. 0xCCCFFF is a place for
      small experiments where systems may break, troubleshooting is part of the point, and recovery
      matters as much as getting it right the first time.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="note" aria-labelledby="sessions-title">
    <div>
      <p class="kicker">Sessions</p>
      <h2 id="sessions-title">Session archive</h2>
    </div>
    <p>
      Session notes, experiments, links, code, and results will collect here as 0xCCCFFF sessions
      happen.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="link-list">
    <a href="/teaching/bvs1/">
      <div>
        <small>Teaching · BVS1</small>
        <h2>Back to Betriebssysteme</h2>
        <p>Course material, semester snapshots, and the Open Lab.</p>
      </div>
      <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
    </a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
